Named presets carry only the dock/charger body's published envelope and the
port/capacity counts the catalog sources. The chassis profile, seat size/angle,
connector position/role, generic opening shapes and service-cover construction
are our explicit archetype rules. They do not reproduce a manufacturer's shell.
USB-C boss dimensions reference the keystone plug standard part; that does not
establish that a named dock's connector has that role or position.

No artwork, logos, textures or photographic tracing are included. Names identify
published facts nominatively; no affiliation or endorsement is implied. Seat
fit, electrical operation, physical compatibility and manufacture are unverified.
